{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Green = healthy · Yellow = watch · Red = above 1% failed requests.**\n\n| What you see | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| **Failed requests %** | Share of API calls that failed (timeout / network / non-2xx). Target: under **1%**. |\n| **Users** | Concurrent virtual users. After the test ends this drops to 0 — use **Peak users** for the 50 / 600 figure. |\n| **Requests / sec** | How hard the API is being hit. |\n| **p95 latency** | 95% of requests were faster than this. Provisional interactive gate ≈ **3s**. |\n\nSet the time picker (top-right) to cover the full run. **Client PASS/FAIL** is still the HTML report from GitHub Actions — this board is the live engineering view."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "This run (selected time window) — set the clock to the full test first",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 20,
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peak users",
      "description": "Highest concurrent VUs in the selected window (the number you configured, e.g. 50 or 600).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 21,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max_over_time(max(k6_vus)[$__range:])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Peak VUs"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" },
          "noValue": "—"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peak requests / sec",
      "description": "Busiest 1-minute request rate in the selected window.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "id": 22,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max_over_time(sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))[$__range:])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Peak RPS"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" },
          "noValue": "—"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failed requests % (window)",
      "description": "Average share of failed API calls in the window. Uses k6 http_req_failed (0–100%). Target under 1%. Shows 0% when healthy — not “No data”.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "id": 23,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg_over_time((avg(k6_http_req_failed_rate))[$__range:])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Failed %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Slowest p95 (window)",
      "description": "Highest p95 latency seen across endpoints in the window (milliseconds).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 5 },
      "id": 24,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max_over_time(max(k6_http_req_duration_p95)[$__range:])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Max p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "—",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 3000 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5000 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Live now (last sample in the window)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "id": 25,
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Users now",
      "description": "Goes to 0 after ramp-down. Use Peak users above for the configured VU count.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_vus)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "VUs"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests / sec now",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 11 },
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "RPS"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failed requests % now",
      "description": "Overall fail rate right now (all APIs combined). Green under 0.5%, yellow to 1%, red above 1%.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 11 },
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(k6_http_req_failed_rate)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Failed %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latency p95 now",
      "description": "Current overall p95 (slowest series). Provisional interactive gate ≈ 3s.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 11 },
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_http_req_duration_p95)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "—",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 3000 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5000 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "" },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Users over time",
      "description": "Ramp up → hold at target → ramp down to 0.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "id": 6,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_vus)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Concurrent users"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 20 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API traffic",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Requests / sec"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed requests % (all APIs together)",
      "description": "One overall line for k6 HTTP failures, plus app vs timeout/network. Target under 1%.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(k6_http_req_failed_rate)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP failed %"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(k6_application_errors_total[1m])) or on() vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m])), 1e-9)",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "App errors (non-2xx)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(k6_transport_errors_total[1m])) or on() vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m])), 1e-9)",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "Timeouts / network"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0.05,
          "noValue": "0",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Session health",
      "description": "Should stay near 100%. Drop = journeys or heartbeats failing.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 23 },
      "id": 9,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(k6_journey_success_rate)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Full journey OK"
        },
        {
          "expr": "avg(k6_heartbeat_success_rate)",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "Heartbeat OK"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0.9,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency p95 by product area",
      "description": "One line per area (venue / music / events / social / chat) — not one line per URL.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_venue_api_duration_p95)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "venue"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_music_api_duration_p95)",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "music"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_event_api_duration_p95)",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "events"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_social_api_duration_p95)",
          "refId": "D",
          "legendFormat": "social"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_chat_api_duration_p95)",
          "refId": "E",
          "legendFormat": "chat"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 3000 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5000 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "showLegend": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Overall latency — p95 and p99",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_http_req_duration_p95)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p95 (all APIs)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(k6_http_req_duration_p99)",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p99 (all APIs)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2 }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["niteout", "k6", "performance"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "NiteOut k6 — Live Load Test",
  "uid": "niteout-k6-overview",
  "version": 4,
  "description": "Live load view with correct k6 Prometheus metric names. Failed % uses k6_http_req_failed_rate (not a non-existent _count). Client sign-off = HTML report."
}
